---
Create malformed input test suite.

Feed invalid/corrupt data to project_load, sample_io_load, and other
input parsers to verify they handle it gracefully without crashes.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Test loading truncated .sqproj files
- [ ] Test loading .sqproj with invalid JSON
- [ ] Test loading .sqproj with missing required fields
- [ ] Test loading .sqproj with out-of-range numeric values
- [ ] Test loading truncated/corrupt WAV files
- [ ] Test loading WAV with invalid header fields
- [ ] All tests pass without crashes, ASan violations, or undefined behavior

## Test Plan
- [ ] Create corpus of malformed .sqproj files (truncated, invalid JSON, missing fields, overflow values)
- [ ] Create corpus of malformed WAV files (truncated, bad headers, zero-length)
- [ ] Feed each to respective loader, verify graceful failure
- [ ] Run under ASan and UBSan
